{"v":4,"catch":"發射、粉碎、征服！在充滿動作、破壞與樂趣的繽紛彈弓冒險中盡情開戰！","desc":"Monster Slingshot Smash 是一款節奏明快的街機益智遊戲。玩家要用彈弓發射古怪又有趣的怪物，在明亮繽紛的世界中摧毀敵人的高塔。精準瞄準，觸發爽快的連鎖反應，摧毀各種瘋狂建築，並在有趣又充滿挑戰的關卡中擊敗搞笑的藍色怪物。遊戲操作簡單、容易上手，卻讓人欲罷不能，結合爆炸性的動作體驗與充滿趣味的視覺風格，帶來令人上癮的手機遊戲體驗。","publisher":"Gametry","release":"2026-09-10","genres":["動作","街機"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["英文"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"普遍級","size":"Switch 2 0.3GB / Switch 0.3GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/3d9cb6ab20a375383f0293d04e8fd83ba9ea0db189768a57575bebeaf7692dd7.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/d61d775807b1862ddae267ce229a36063eee1719006535aada2fc1d668525e3a.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/10432ce2c1ba05016456f6dd321adff40c372dd56dd7119efddcbb94c27c874e.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/51148a947d65d3a51c90190b689fc2c8d72054b37689b5bf6cd15835a2522756.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/6a3fa6fd607f7eda25da532ada0ff3bc6042a6fdb453a11e5556a8cf0899b68c.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/ec6dfcc45c993049bf9597f25096e0383a4f827170ec2b8e59e81640d1270a85.jpg"],"titleId":"0100733028322000","dlc":[]}